				mes "A giant... a giant in a cave...";
				mes "He...He got hurt trying to protect me...";
				mes "He wouldn't move!";
				mes "His body was getting cold.";
				next;
				mes "[Wounded Laphine]";
				mes "We were each other's enemy......";
				mes "but he saved me...";
				mes "I heard they need a bradium to live!";
